title:: CaosTrack
summary:: 32-step pattern for one track (step model).
categories:: CaosBox
related:: Classes/CaosSequencer, Classes/CaosInstrument

description::
Each track (link::Classes/CaosBox#*tracks::) is a CaosTrack. The mode defines what
each step stores:

list::
## code::\snapshot::: stores the resolved value when the step is marked (percussion).
## code::\live::: stores only the gate and resolves the voice on trigger (melodic).
::

instancemethods::

subsection:: API

method:: putStep
method:: put
method:: clear
method:: at
method:: step
code::
t = CaosTrack.new(\bass, \live, 32);
t.putStep(0, true);
t.putStep(4, true);
t.clear(4);
t.step(0);
::

method:: setInstrument
method:: releaseInstrument
The first voice enters immediately; a replacement stays pending until the next
trigger (code::activatePending::).

method:: onChange
Callback code::{|track, index, value| ... }:: when a step changes; the GUI uses it
to redraw.
